#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:5 b8983e1e081d4237bdc97e5e88c81bb4
msgid "Installing Git"
msgstr "安装 Git"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:9 4dab2255b45a4cc4beefd1d6ae930288
msgid ""
"Git is a free and open source distributed version control system that is "
"used to manage ArduPilot codebase. Git is available on all major OS "
"platforms, and a variety of tools exist to make it easier to get started."
msgstr ""
"git 是一个免费开源的分布式版本控制系统，用于管理 ArduPilot 代码库。git "
"可在所有主流操作系统平台上使用，并且有多种工具可以帮助你快速上手。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:13 9e300213c87f429f87831ce8cb7a20a3
msgid "Git command line"
msgstr "Git 命令行"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:16 784c3e8a343d48b2b6a385cf4dd4ce17
msgid "Ubuntu"
msgstr "Ubuntu"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:18 eec6b341ce664f0290d8b7a51fe6243e
msgid "Linux/Ubuntu users can install with apt :"
msgstr "Linux/Ubuntu 用户可通过 apt 安装："

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:20 97d073fae6a04a509a80240be4cf7dcf
msgid "``sudo apt-get update``"
msgstr "``sudo apt-get update``"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:21 27b55094daee43d486fb504ca07e72a2
msgid "``sudo apt-get install git``"
msgstr "``sudo apt-get install git``"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:22 2df3bb8da5c3434fb87390bd6dabc321
msgid "``sudo apt-get install gitk git-gui``"
msgstr "``sudo apt-get install gitk git-gui``"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:28 6313a3b867304ab29962d05c35af38f9
msgid "Windows and other Systems"
msgstr "Windows 及其他系统"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:30 2a82aceed41c4e9989305f10606a5e8d
msgid ""
"download and install from `git-scm.com's download page <http://git-"
"scm.com/downloads>`__"
msgstr "从 `git-scm.com 下载页面 <http://git-scm.com/downloads>`__ 下载并安装"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:33 9ef804cec96f4920bf05e4fc0f2f64ce
msgid "Recommended GUI Tools"
msgstr "推荐的 GUI 工具"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:35 9ace8c48199e4af6a95a6bd0fda8b0aa
msgid ""
"The git command line, gitk and git-gui tools are the basics that all users "
"should have installed and are available from a few places."
msgstr "git 命令行、gitk 和 git-gui 是所有用户都应安装的基础工具，可从多个渠道获取。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:37 3f13f0ff8b28481da94584f429a7de57
msgid ""
"A comprehensive list of GUI tools are listed `here on git-scm.com "
"<https://git-scm.com/downloads/guis>`__ but here are a few of the developer "
"favourites:"
msgstr ""
"GUI 工具的完整列表可在 `git-scm.com <https://git-scm.com/downloads/guis>`__ "
"上找到，以下是开发者最喜爱的几款："

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:39 8ac5750de64c4ec0914c71be42aa9624
msgid ""
"`GitHub Desktop <https://desktop.github.com/>`__ for Windows and Mac is an "
"easy to use tool with good GitHub integration but has fewer features than "
"other clients."
msgstr ""
"适用于 Windows 和 Mac 的 `GitHub Desktop <https://desktop.github.com/>`__ "
"是一款易于使用且与 GitHub 集成良好的工具，但功能比其他客户端少。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:40 a1d762b5271b41be90dee9c21ddb5b14
msgid ""
"`Sourcetree for Windows and Mac OSX <https://www.sourcetreeapp.com/>`__ is a"
" full featured tool with a nice interface with many features including "
"allowing individual lines from a file to be included in a new commit "
"(simpler tools only allow the entire file to be included)"
msgstr ""
"适用于 Windows 和 Mac OSX 的 `Sourcetree <https://www.sourcetreeapp.com/>`__ "
"是一款界面友好、功能丰富的工具，支持将文件中的单独行包含在新提交中（较简单的工具只能包含整个文件）。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:41 69e49e25c3854353a8e5d835ce956fe2
msgid ""
"`GitKraken <https://www.gitkraken.com/>`__ is a a full featured tool for "
"Windows, Mac and Linux"
msgstr ""
"`GitKraken <https://www.gitkraken.com/>`__ 是适用于 Windows、Mac 和 Linux 的全功能工具。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:46 6332c55954ef4d36b58f4b7ebd717081
msgid "GitHub Desktop"
msgstr "GitHub Desktop"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:48 5c81be9262614afe8aa17ed86923b536
msgid ""
"Go to the `desktop.github.com <https://desktop.github.com/>`__ and push the "
"\"Download for Windows\" or \"Download for macOS\" buttons in the middle of "
"the page"
msgstr ""
"访问 `desktop.github.com <https://desktop.github.com/>`__，点击页面中间的「Download for"
" Windows」或「Download for macOS」按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:53 e6814806344142748dcbd39ed323ccb0
msgid ""
"Save the **GitHubSetup.exe** somewhere on your machine and then run it and "
"follow the instructions to install GitHub client"
msgstr "将 **GitHubSetup.exe** 保存到计算机的某个位置，然后运行并按照提示安装 GitHub 客户端"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:54 220df09b96f646fda2d536bdedbe568b
msgid ""
"On GitHub client click the right arrow button to view a list of recent "
"commits or right-mouse-button click on the ardupilot/ardupilot repository "
"and \"open in explorer\"."
msgstr ""
"在 GitHub 客户端中，点击右箭头按钮可查看最近的 commit 列表，或右键单击 ardupilot/ardupilot "
"仓库选择「在资源管理器中打开」。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:59 86c406cfd3ba4f8a9f5747abc4251edc
msgid "Ensure your github settings are set to leave line endings untouched."
msgstr "确保您的 github 设置为保持行尾不变。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:61 561f426f5ce5477d977e33e52b5f7d98
msgid ""
"The \"Git Shell (or Bash)\" terminal was also installed when you installed "
"Git.  Click on your new \"Git Shell (or Bash)\" Icon and type in the "
"following in the Git \"MINGW32\" Terminal window:"
msgstr ""
"安装 Git 时，「Git Shell（或 Bash）」终端也已一并安装。点击新出现的「Git Shell（或 Bash）」图标，在 "
"Git「MINGW32」终端窗口中输入以下命令："

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:69 f363e38ab4d24f259523f1a0971590b7
msgid ""
"You can now also open the file in your favourite editor such as `NotePad++ "
"<http://notepad-plus-plus.org/>`__, `Sublime Text "
"<http://www.sublimetext.com/>`__ or `acme <http://acme.cat-v.org/>`__."
msgstr ""
"现在也可以用您喜欢的编辑器打开文件，例如 `NotePad++ <http://notepad-plus-plus.org/>`__、`Sublime "
"Text <http://www.sublimetext.com/>`__ 或 `acme <http://acme.cat-v.org/>`__。"
